WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:08,410
you are poisoned

2
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:12,080
Poison? How could the prince be poisoned?

3
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,840
What poison

4
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,840
This poison is so sinister

5
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:18,840
Start from the legs

6
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:19,840
Drill into the bone

7
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,840
stretch into the tendons

8
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,840
It doesn’t matter that your leg is useless.

9
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:25,840
Wait for the poisonous gas to spread to the internal organs

10
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,840
By then you won’t even be able to stand up even if you want to.

11
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,160
It’s hard to save the gods

12
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,320
It's a good thing that your bones were dispersed in time.

13
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,320
Otherwise, these two medicinal properties

14
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,670
stir together

15
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:37,670
The onset of the attack is faster than now, Uncle San

16
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:38,670
Sister Shen Huai

17
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:39,670
As expected, you still took action

18
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,670
In my previous life, you planned for me to lose my code.

19
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:43,670
In this life, you will see that my legs are useless

20
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,670
But still don't worry

21
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,670
You must put me to death

22
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:55,210
Eat this for seven days first
